leshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas de despliegue","Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/deployment/troubleshooting",{"_82":493},"deployment/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_59":495,"_66":103,"_79":-7,"_61":496},"es:_13","Otros modelos",{"_59":498,"_66":76,"_61":499,"_70":500,"_79":-7,"_11":501,"_80":502},"es:deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx","Despliega desde AWS Marketplace","Ejecuta una instancia preconfigurada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/deployment/aws-marketplace",{"_82":503},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_59":505,"_66":76,"_61":506,"_70":507,"_79":-7,"_11":508,"_80":509},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/deployment/saas",{"_82":510},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_217":513},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/kubernetes.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/images/kubernetes.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_66":67,"_61":516,"_68":27,"_69":-7,"_70":517,"_72":-7,"_63":518,"_59":526,"_80":527,"_79":529},"Actualizaciones","Guía de versión a versión para el operador",[519],{"_59":520,"_66":76,"_61":521,"_70":522,"_79":-7,"_11":523,"_80":524},"es:upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","3.8.0 a 4.0.0","Qué cambia en la arquitectura de 4.0.0, qué cambios rompen un despliegue 3.8.0, cómo actualizar paso a paso una release de Helm y cómo validar el resultado.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-58/es/upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0",{"_82":525},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","es:upgrades",{"_217":528},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\